16:19:53.0601027+02:00: root Information: 0 : Cegid.Framework.Data | SqlService | [PGI] SELECT TOP 1 * 
                            FROM ETABLISS
                            LEFT JOIN PAYS ON PY_PAYS = ET_PAYS
