16:21:54.1271489+02:00: root Information: 0 : Cegid.Framework.Data | SqlService | [PGI] SELECT ET_ETABLISSEMENT, GPK_CAISSE 
                            FROM ETABLISS
                            LEFT JOIN PAYS ON ET_PAYS = PY_PAYS
                            LEFT JOIN PARCAISSE ON ET_ETABLISSEMENT = GPK_ETABLISSEMENT
