16:22:08.6732710+02:00: root Information: 0 : Cegid.Framework.Data | SqlService | [PGI] SELECT c.MNG_CLOID, c.MNG_DAEMONID, c.MNG_CAISSE, DAE_ETABLISS, c.MNG_LEVEL, c.MNG_CLOTYPE, 
                c.MNG_TARGETDATE, c.MNG_DATEEXEC, c.MNG_TOTALHT, c.MNG_TOTALTTC, c.MNG_TOTALHTPERP, c.MNG_TOTALTTCPERP, c.MNG_DEVISE, 
